INSERT INTO `news` VALUES ('5', 'Michael Kors 2026 春夏纽约时装周', '<p>The Michael Kors Spring/Summer 2026 collection successfully delivered a vision ofeffortless luxuryandgrounded sensuality. It championed wearable, versatile pieces that blend polished metropolitan style with the relaxed ease of a global traveler, all while promoting a sense of calm and escape.迈克尔·科尔斯 2026 春夏系列成功地呈现了 ** effortless luxury（ effortless 奢华）** 与 ** grounded sensuality（接地气的性感）** 的愿景。它主推可穿性强、用途多样的单品，将精致的大都会风格与全球旅行者的 relaxed 自在感相融合，同时宣扬一种宁静与逃离之感。<br></p><p><br></p><p>Michael Kors Spring/Summer 2026 Collection: Earthly Elegance迈克尔·科尔斯 2026 春夏系列：大地优雅<br></p><p><br></p><p>Michael Kors officially opened New York Fashion Week on September 11, 2025, with the presentation of his Spring/Summer 2026 collection. The show was held at the Terminal Warehouse in Chelsea, transformed into a sun-drenched desert escape with earthy terracotta tones, wooden walls, and sculptural natural elements like towering cacti.迈克尔·科尔斯于2025年9月11日正式揭开了纽约时装周的序幕，发布其2026春夏系列。大秀在切尔西的Terminal Warehouse举行，现场被打造为一个阳光普照的沙漠避世之所，充满陶土色调、木质墙面和如巨型仙人掌等雕塑感自然元素。<br></p><p><br></p><p>The collection, titled\"Earthly Elegance\", drew inspiration fromglobal traveland theuntamed beauty of nature. Kors aimed to capture the balance between the raw power of nature and refined sophistication, envisioning clothes for both city life and far-flung escapes. He stated,\"The simple fact is, escaping the everyday is more important to us than ever... The震撼 of nature is always unforgettable, but to balance it with elegance and refinement is the spirit I wanted to capture this season.\"该系列名为“大地优雅”，从全球旅行和自然野性之美中汲取灵感。科尔斯旨在捕捉自然原始力量与精致 sophistication 之间的平衡，设想出既适合都市生活又适合远方逃离的服装。他说道：“简单的事实是，逃离日常对我们而言比以往任何时候都更加重要……自然的震撼力总是令人难忘，但将其与优雅和精致相平衡，是我这一季想要捕捉的精神。”<br></p><p><br></p><p>图片URL：<br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013566340.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013566340.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013564801.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013564801.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013575212.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013575212.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013572603.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013572603.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013572714.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013572714.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013576975.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013576975.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/20250919101357126.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/20250919101357126.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013576847.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013576847.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013577338.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013577338.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013576389.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013576389.jpg\" style=\"\"/><br><img src=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/202509191013574010.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"https://img1.cfw.cn/editors/attached/image/20250919/20250919